  "Id": "d17f4b86-2ea9-4c50-b6d3-90c58a31f7e2"/*SkinPoints*/,
  "Description": "Deforms a point buffer with skin weights and skinning matrices - the point counterpart of [SkinMesh], so particles and point effects can ride a rig.\n\nGenerate the weights with [BindToSkeleton] (with the same point buffer connected to its Points input). Separator points and points outside every envelope pass through unchanged.",
